VTID-03795 — commands.log
==========================

## Step 1 — kill the obvious hypothesis before writing code

The candidate carried over from VTID-03790 was the
`<<VERTEX_WAKE_BRIEF_OVERRIDE_ACTIVE>>` sentinel leaking into model-facing
text. Tested against 14 days of real telemetry FIRST:

  (Supabase) greeting_sent wake_opener x nova_validation outcome
  -> override_v2 : 26 sessions, 13 blocked, 13 CLEAN  (50% succeed)
  -> (none)      : 268 sessions, 92 blocked, 176 clean (~34% ambient)

override_v2 sessions carry the marker AND the SPOKEN FIRST UTTERANCE block and
succeed half the time => neither is a sufficient cause. HYPOTHESIS KILLED. No
code was written for it.

## Step 2 — size correlation

  (Supabase) bucket every nova_instruction_debug_dump (7d) by instruction_chars
             against nova_validation outcome
  -> >= 32768 : 2 sessions, 2 BLOCKED (100%), range 33766-33778
  -> <  32768 : 37 sessions, 5 blocked (13.5%), max clean 32431

