## Step 5 — verify the wiring assumption BEFORE trusting the fix

Critical: if the guided block were appended AFTER buildLiveSystemInstruction
runs, a bootstrapContext-based detector would always return false and the fix
would be inert.

$ grep -rn "buildGuidedTopicNarrationBlock" src/ | grep -v prompt.ts
-> src/routes/orb-live.ts:7777      (inside a + chain)
-> src/routes/orb-livekit.ts:1920

$ read src/routes/orb-live.ts:7755-7804
-> the concatenation ending at 7781 is the 3rd positional argument; line 7782
   is session.active_role (param 4 = activeRole). CONFIRMED: the guided block
   IS inside bootstrapContext at call time.

