## Step 7 — the fix

- guided-topic-narration-prompt.ts: exported
  GUIDED_TOPIC_NARRATION_BLOCK_HEADINGS + containsGuidedTopicNarrationBlock().
- live-system-instruction.ts: computed `guidedTopicNarrationActive` from
  bootstrapContext; the GUIDED JOURNEY block is now a ternary — compact
  one-line form when guided, the FULL original block otherwise (byte-identical
  to before for every non-guided session).

